1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Skip Wuzhen — ¥150 just to get in.
I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,000
This canal town is just as old — and free.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,300
Shaxi, in Taicang, an hour from Shanghai.

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,600
Over 1,300 years of Ming and Qing streets.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,000
Stone bridges, canals, no ticket gate.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,400
Locals still live and trade along the water.

7
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,600
Double-tap if you'd skip the paid town.

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,200
The famous water towns charge ¥100 to ¥190.

9
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,000
★ Expert Tip: go on a weekday — Shaxi stays quiet.

10
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,600
So: free Shaxi or ¥150 Wuzhen? Tell me I'm wrong.
